                 ("Collected data or information", ["gathered", "compiled", "recorded", "surveyed", "captured", "logged"], "Gathered price data on 300 grocery items a week across 5 supermarkets"),
                 ("Collected samples or evidence", ["sampled", "drew", "swabbed", "extracted", "obtained", "secured"], "Drew 18 blood samples a day on home visits with a 96% first-attempt rate"),
