                 ("Supported someone’s growth", ["supported", "mentored", "coached", "nurtured", "developed", "backed"], "Mentored 5 teaching assistants toward their own classrooms; 4 are now lead teachers"),
                 ("Promoted a habit or a behavior", ["promoted", "reinforced", "rewarded", "fostered", "modeled", "championed"], "Rewarded near-miss reports with a monthly lunch and raised reporting from 3 a month to 25"),
