                 ("Say it in the active voice", ["earned", "won", "received", "achieved", "ranked", "merited"], "Won 2 regional safety awards in 4 years as site superintendent"),
                 ("You spotted something", ["identified", "noticed", "spotted", "detected", "saw", "caught"], "Spotted a billing pattern that pointed to $90K in undercharged freight"),
                 ("You gave credit to others", ["praised", "thanked", "rewarded", "acknowledged", "credited", "celebrated"], "Rewarded 30 perfect-attendance employees a quarter with a paid half day; absence fell by 20%"),
