                 ("Repaired buildings and fittings", ["patched", "mended", "renovated", "refinished", "rewired", "replumbed"], "Refinished 60 hardwood floors a year for 3 real-estate agencies"),
                 ("Repaired clothes or goods", ["altered", "stitched", "sewed", "reupholstered", "refurbished", "resoled"], "Altered about 50 garments a week, including 10 wedding dresses a season"),
