                 ("Gathered views or requirements", ["interviewed", "surveyed", "asked", "polled", "consulted", "recorded"], "Interviewed 18 warehouse staff to list what a new scanner system had to do, 42 items in all"),
                 ("Gathered people", ["convened", "rallied", "brought together", "organized", "called", "mustered"], "Rallied 70 parents to a school-board meeting that restored 2 bus routes"),
                 ("Gathered items or samples", ["picked", "harvested", "sampled", "retrieved", "fetched", "rounded up"], "Sampled water at 45 wells a month for a county health lab"),
